  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_3802.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Desde este mediod&iacute;a y hasta el s&aacute;bado, 17 de agosto, Fanzara se encuentra sumergida en su II Feria Medieval, con multitud de paradas y actividades paralelas, como los torneos medievales de las tardes de estos jueves y viernes, a las 20 horas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3782.jpg\" alt=\"img_3782\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3783.jpg\" alt=\"img_3783\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3784.jpg\" alt=\"img_3784\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3785.jpg\" alt=\"img_3785\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3786.jpg\" alt=\"img_3786\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3787.jpg\" alt=\"img_3787\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3788.jpg\" alt=\"img_3788\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3789.jpg\" alt=\"img_3789\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugferiamedievalfanzara13/img_3790.jpg\" alt=\"img_3790\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub